"via autogiro tills vidare."

#: app/assets/javascripts/app/views/subscription.jst.eco:233
msgid ""
"If you do not have a VAT ID, please enter the identification number of your "
"company, otherwise the invoice will be created with the German Tax rate"
msgstr ""
"Om du inte har ett momsregistreringsnummer, ange ditt företags "
"organisationsnummer, annars kommer fakturan att skapas med den tyska "
"skattesatsen"

